        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25FdFRIbEpYM3BFWDJwSU1VNXNVMFF6U0ZoM2VrRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403ff8733c87ef7:0x28e98f91c8f034aa"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ937IM4f_AzQRqjTwyJGP6Sg/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNBMnZDLVd3EAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 年前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "沒想到這家店這麼小。至少在我們去的那天，來喝酒的人比吃飯的人多。服務生都很友善。因為地方小，喝了幾杯之後，周圍的人就特別吵鬧。他們也允許坐在門口的顧客抽煙，這讓我們覺得有點太舒服了。食物味道還不錯，但對我來說有點貴。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Didn’t expect the place to be so tiny. More people came for drinks than food, at least on the day we were here. The servers were really friendly. Due to the small space, it got quite noisy especially with the people around us after having had a few drinks. They also allowed customers to smoke if they sat at the doorway which was too pleasant for us. But the food were above average but a tad too expensive for me.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Dariel Lim",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104797718934444749009/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzWC9AfYSVZaH4RM7McasGTY4z7TJzELPutqFaIm9CDJ3Wz9h8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
        },
        "publishTime": "2018-07-29T04:17:52.720Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNBMnZDLVd3EAE&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNBMnZDLVd3EAE!2m1!1s0x3403ff8733c87ef7:0x28e98f91c8f034aa"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ937IM4f_AzQRqjTwyJGP6Sg/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCNFpTZ3pBRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "餐廳氣氛看起來不錯，所以我們決定去試試，結果剛坐下幾秒鐘就後悔了。服務生態度冷淡。我們點的開胃菜——西班牙辣香腸和辣雞——油膩膩的，而且份量很少。看起來和吃起來都像是我們自己在家就能做的。性價比極低。\n\n服務生們在後廚邊吃邊聊，還漏掉了我們的訂單。雖然我覺得在顧客面前吃東西不太合適，但當時快要打烊了，所以也情有可原。但是，糟糕的服務還要收取10%的服務費，這實在令人無法接受。\n\n我們以後不會再去這家餐廳了。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The atmosphere seemed nice so we decided to give it a try, but boy did we regret it within seconds after being seated. The waitress wasn't the warmest. The Chorizos and spicy chicken we got as appetizers were soaked in oil and the portion sizes were small. It looked and tasted like something we could've made at home. Overpriced food for what you get.\n\nThey were standing around and eating in the back all while forgetting one of our orders. Although I thought it was inappropriate to eat in front of customers, it was almost closing time so that was fine. But the 10% service charge for bad service was unacceptable.\n\nWe will not be going here again.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Jeta Thaya",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111377223151518510019/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWipHDPcmPPEY8vX4sCFlzkGqNlf4vtbfQM5zaA1KSUMOXWoyOj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2023-01-21T15:16:50.399803Z",
